-- title:
--   True original spatial stopped Itô-Meyer signed cash inequality with full compensated negative marks
-- statement:
--   Establish the genuine stopped Ito-Meyer verification inequality for original spatial-upcross clipped clock, full actual Stieltjes dividend cash and ruin-contact terminal state. The Gaussian intrinsic source and the complete compensated negative-jump Jfull including large marks supply the two stochastic channels; a nonpositive remainder accounts for HJB generator and dividend gradient terms. No small-mark-only simplification and no fabricated witness.

